      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "Initialize a k_heap at run time over a caller-provided memory buffer with k_heap_init(), then confirm the heap is usable: a block can be allocated (and the returned memory lies within the provided region and is writable), an allocation larger than the region fails, and the block can be freed.\nSee also: k_heap_init()",
