      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "The test allocates 4 blocks from heap memory pool using k_malloc() API. It also tries to allocate a block of size 64 bytes which fails as all the memory is allocated up. It then validates k_free() API by freeing up all the blocks which were allocated from the heap memory.\nSee also: k_malloc()",
      "externalIdentifier": [
