      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "The test resizes blocks previously allocated from the system heap with k_realloc(), growing and shrinking allocations and verifying the contents are preserved and that allocation back to the system heap works.\nSee also: k_realloc()",
