      "description": "Static define and Dynamic define stacks, Then initialize them. Current thread push or pop data item into the stack. Create a new thread pop or push data item into the stack. Controlled by semaphore. Verify data passing between threads via stack And verify stack can be define at compile time.\nSee also: k_stack_init(), k_stack_push(), K_STACK_DEFINE(x), k_stack_pop()",
