      "description": "This test verifies the behavior of the CPU mask APIs in the Zephyr kernel for thread lifecycle management. It ensures that the APIs behave as expected when operating on both running and non-running threads.\nNote: This test is only executed if CONFIG_SCHED_CPU_MASK is enabled. Otherwise, the test is skipped.",
