      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "Create a thread with the priority lower than the current thread which is cooperative and suspend it, make sure it doesn't gets scheduled, and resume and check if the entry function is executed.\nSee also: k_thread_suspend(), k_thread_resume()",
      "externalIdentifier": [
