      "description": "Create 3 threads with main thread with priority 0 and other threads with -1, 0 ,+1 priority. Now -1 priority thread gets executed and it is made to sleep for 10 sec. Now, wake up the -1 priority thread and check if it starts executing.\nSee also: k_wakeup()",
