      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "Create multiple preemptive threads with same priorities and few with same priorities and enable the time slice. Ensure that each thread is given the time slice period to execute.\nSkipped when CONFIG_TIMESLICING is disabled.\nSee also: k_sched_time_slice_set()",
