      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "Validates initial duration and period of timer.\nIt initializes the timer with k_timer_init(), then starts the timer using k_timer_start() with specific initial duration and period. Stops the timer using k_timer_stop() and checks for proper completion of duration and period.\nSee also: k_timer_init(), k_timer_start(), k_timer_stop(), k_uptime_get(), k_busy_wait()",
