      "description": "Validates initial timer duration, keeping timer period to K_FOREVER. Basically, acting as one-shot timer. It initializes the timer with k_timer_init(), then starts the timer using k_timer_start() with specific initial duration and period as zero. Stops the timer using k_timer_stop() and checks for proper completion.\nSee also: k_timer_init(), k_timer_start(), k_timer_stop(), k_uptime_get(), k_busy_wait()",
