      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "Timer test to validate timer status and next trigger expiry time\nIt initializes the timer with k_timer_init(), then starts the timer using k_timer_start() and checks for timer current status with k_timer_status_get() and remaining time before next expiry using k_timer_remaining_get(). Stops the timer using k_timer_stop().\nSee also: k_timer_init(), k_timer_start(), k_timer_status_get(), k_timer_remaining_get(), k_timer_stop()",
